---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Project Goto — Archieval Mariano"
  description="GOTO is a limited morning (GOTO) and evening (TOGO) news reader for non-touch e-ink devices running CrossPoint Reader."
>
  <section class="wrap goto">
    <header class="goto__head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Project</p>
      <h1>GOTO</h1>
      <p class="goto__tagline">A limited news reader for e-ink devices.</p>
    </header>

    <p class="goto__lede">
      GOTO/TOGO delivers a limited morning (GOTO) and evening (TOGO) news briefing
      to non-touch e-ink readers running CrossPoint Reader. Open an edition, read a
      fixed set of story leads, and scan a QR code if you want to continue a story
      on your phone. That’s it. No endless feed, and no need to read every story in
      full.
    </p>

    <section class="goto__section">
      <h2>Concept</h2>
      <p>
        Each edition is a fixed set of stories chosen for that morning or evening.
        GOTO is the morning paper. TOGO is the evening takeaway. The names play on
        something being prepared and ready to pick up, with the edition waiting for
        you when you open it. Once you reach the end, you are done.
      </p>
    </section>

    <hr class="rule" />
    <section class="goto__section">
      <h2>Supported hardware</h2>
      <p>
        Built first for the non-touch XTEINK X4 running CrossPoint Reader. Support
        for other CrossPoint-compatible e-ink devices may follow as the project
        develops.
      </p>
    </section>

    <hr class="rule" />
    <section class="goto__section">
      <h2>Installation</h2>
      <p>
        A public build is not available yet. Installation instructions will be
        added once the hosted edition service and release firmware are ready.
      </p>
    </section>

    <hr class="rule" />
    <section class="goto__section">
      <h2>Notes</h2>
      <p>
        Project Goto is still in active development. The current version uses GMA
        News as its source.
      </p>
    </section>

    <p class="goto__note">
      Part of Archieval Mariano’s e-ink / CrossPoint projects. Stories and reporting
      remain with their original publishers.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .goto {
    max-width: var(--measure);
    padding-block: var(--space-lg) var(--space-xl);
  }
  .goto__head {
    border-bottom: var(--heavy-rule);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-md);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }
  .goto__head h1 {
    font-size: var(--step-3);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    margin-top: var(--space-xs);
  }
  .goto__tagline {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin: var(--space-sm) 0 0;
  }
  .goto__lede {
    font-size: var(--step-0);
    line-height: 1.72;
    color: var(--ink);
    max-width: 42rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }
  .goto__section {
    margin-block: var(--space-lg);
  }
  .goto__section h2 {
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }
  .goto__section p {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    max-width: 42rem;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .goto__note {
    margin-top: var(--space-lg);
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
</style>
